  "ingredients": [
    "1 pound ripe strawberries, hulled and chopped",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "1 pinch salt",
    "1.5 teaspoons cornstarch",
    "1.5 teaspoons cold water",
    "3 tablespoons lemon juice"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/B4HWTnPlQRNokvU5RiGRg75PvqA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/168360-sweet-and-silky-strawberry-sorbet-VAT-005-step-01-aa0313ef74df48c791b27e4183a36ac9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/168360/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place berries in the bowl of a food processor and puree until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/J8XiAPUPESg-yW9yNc0KKsl4j-k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/168360-sweet-and-silky-strawberry-sorbet-VAT-006-step-02-67ecd0d21e3d429f937f507837605127.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/168360/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer pureed strawberry mixture into a large saucepan over medium heat. Add sugar and salt; stir until dissolved and bring to a simmer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HkeDZOc6KjnMze4VdN-3ZsQnOc0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/168360-sweet-and-silky-strawberry-sorbet-VAT-007-step-03-01stirring-f49a39636d104ddab0bfdb7d439299f3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/168360/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk cornstarch and cold water together in a small bowl until smooth; stir into simmering strawberry mixture. Remove the saucepan from heat, stir in lemon juice, and allow to cool slightly. Refrigerate strawberry mixture until cold, about 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/llE_ipkRy8UrYVWg4omi5CRc5a0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/168360-sweet-and-silky-strawberry-sorbet-VAT-008-step-04-01noplastic-738da61124a14e57ab74ee24dcb2a385.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/168360/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Freeze in an ice cream maker according to manufacturer's instructions, about 20 minutes.",
